 story, a variety of engaging enemies, and varied and memorable mini-games, Redeemart will constantly keep you on the edge of your seat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Story Mechanics</h2>Be a part of Jonah's journey to redemption by literally controlling his rebuilding. And be helped along the way by the friends you make.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinctive Visuals</h2>Redeemart features a brand-new engine built from the ground up to power its impressive graphics and excellent performance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Story</h2>Telling a heartfelt tale that will have you invested in its characters.", "short_description": "Trapped in a convenience store with hordes of monsters waiting to devour you. You'll need to build weapons out of items in the store, collect trading cards to grow stronger and rely on the other people in the store to get over a heartbreak. Promising dual joystick action and a story like no other", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198370/header.jpg?t=1749516243", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749516243", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749516243", "website": "https://whateversrightstudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 ／ Intel Core i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 960 or AMD Radeon™ RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</st